  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=120'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >Russian Ornamental</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=120'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=10728'  TARGET='_top' >Primulaceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=120&start_taxon_id=10728'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n<b>Cyclamen</b> L.\n<p>Cyclamen, sowbread \n<p>Дряква  \r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nAccording to different taxonomic treatments, this genus includes 55 or 17 species, mainly in countries around the Mediterranean, Black and Caspian seas.  Russian taxonomists consider there are 8 species in the FSU, all in the Caucasus.  Only two species, <i>C. coum</i> Mill. and <i>C. purpurascens</i> Mill., also occur outside the Caucasus and they are known in cultivation.  The others also are of interest for gardening.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        </P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p>\n<B>Lower Taxa</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442652' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Cyclamen</b> <b>abchasicum</b>  (Medw. ex Kusn.) Kolak.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442653' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Cyclamen</b> <b>adzaricum</b>  Pobed.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442654' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Cyclamen</b> <b>circassicum</b>  Pobed.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442655' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Cyclamen</b> <b>colchicum</b>  (Albov) Albov.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442656' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Cyclamen</b> <b>elegans</b>  Boiss.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442657' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Cyclamen</b> <b>purpurascens</b>  Mill.</A></ul>\n<p>\n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        \r\n                        <P></P>\r\n                      \r\n</div>\r\n                      <P><div id=\"panelTaxonLinks\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableLinkList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD><span id=\"lblLinkTitle\"><font size=\"2\"><b>Related Links</b> (opens in a new window)</font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <P><span id=\"lblLinkList\"><b>Treatments in Other Floras @ www.efloras.org</b><ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=3&taxon_id=108821'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Chinese Plant Names' >Chinese Plant Names</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=101&taxon_id=108821'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Taiwan Checklist' >Flora of Taiwan Checklist</A></ul>\n<p>\n<b>Other Databases</b>\n<ul>\n\n<li><A HREF='http://mobot.mobot.org/cgi-bin/search_pick?name=Cyclamen'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='W3TROPICOS' >W<SUP>3</SUP>TROPICOS</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://www.ipni.org/ipni/IpniServlet?family=&infrafamily=&genus=Cyclamen&infragenus=&species=&infraspecies=&author_abbrev=&publication_title=&is_apni_record=on&is_gci_record=on&is_ik_record=on&include_authors=on&include_basionym_authors=on&query_type=by_query'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='IPNI' >IPNI</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://ravenel.si.edu/botany/ing//INGsearch.cfm?searchWord=Cyclamen'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='ING' >ING Genus Search</A></ul>\n</span></P>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        \r\n</div></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td>\r\n                      <!-- Links -->\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <P><span id=\"lblEditLinks\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <!-- Comment List --></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n              </td>\r\n              <TD id=\"tdRightBar\" valign=\"top\"></TD>\r\n\r\n            </tr>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </TD>\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td>\r\n<table id=\"SubHeaderTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#99cc99\" id=\"SubHeaderTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <TD align=\"center\" bgColor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkHome\" href=\"index.aspx\" target=\"_top\">eFlora Home</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFoot